{
  "key": "letter-136-part-01",
  "number": 136,
  "generationId": "01a1e6ce-0a0b-7842-abdd-1b99e6c93391",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.669887
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Sannyas is a pilgrimage to Mt.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.030862,
      "end": 4.292857
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Everest - naturally there are difficulties on the way.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.513492,
      "end": 8.875193
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "But the fruits of determination are sweet too, so bear everything calmly and joyously but don't give up your commitment.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/04.mp3",
      "start": 10.262472,
      "end": 17.568934000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Serve your mother even more than before - sannyas is not a running away from responsibility.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/05.mp3",
      "start": 18.92576,
      "end": 24.532336
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Your family is not to be given up, rather you have to make the whole world your family.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/06.mp3",
      "start": 25.935033999999998,
      "end": 31.811565
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Encourage your mother to take sannyas too.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/07.mp3",
      "start": 33.224308,
      "end": 35.608005
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Tell her: You have seen enough of the world, now raise your eyes towards God",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/08.mp3",
      "start": 37.062154,
      "end": 42.688005
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "But make sure she is caused no trouble on your account.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/09.mp3",
      "start": 44.167052000000005,
      "end": 47.522721
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "This doesn't mean giving in or compromising - sannyas knows no compromise.",
      "path": "audio/1970-136/10.mp3",
      "start": 49.092177,
      "end": 54.83
    }
  ]
}
